          "content": [
            {
              "text": "The Starting Point",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "The Starting Point"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Acquira had a good problem: the 8X increase in B2B appointments from Case Study 2 meant the company suddenly needed to hire and train many salespeople quickly.",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Acquira had a good problem: the 8X increase in B2B appointments from Case Study 2 meant the company suddenly needed to hire and train many salespeople quickly."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "But sales management doesn't scale easily. Here's what the team faced:",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "But sales management doesn't scale easily. Here's what the team faced:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
