        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "The vision:",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ],
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "The vision:"
            },
            {
              "text": " Let AI handle boring admin work so humans focus on selling and meaningful coaching.",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": " Let AI handle boring admin work so humans focus on selling and meaningful coaching."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Working with Claude",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Working with Claude"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Hayden and his team described what they wanted: \"A system that automatically records sales calls, transcribes them, analyzes them against our sales methodology, scores objectively, identifies coaching opportunities, eliminates manual CRM entry, and generates all reports automatically.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Hayden and his team described what they wanted: \"A system that automatically records sales calls, transcribes them, analyzes them against our sales methodology, scores objectively, identifies coaching opportunities, eliminates manual CRM entry, and generates all reports automatically.\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Claude created Mermaid diagrams showing workflow, wrote technical specifications, and helped think through edge cases and integrations.",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Claude created Mermaid diagrams showing workflow, wrote technical specifications, and helped think through edge cases and integrations."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Acquira hired a developer for $20-30K to build what Claude had designed.",
              "type": "text",
              "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Acquira hired a developer for $20-30K to build what Claude had designed."
            }
          ]
        },
