    "circle_ios_fallback_text": "The Starting PointAcquira had a good problem: the 8X increase in B2B appointments from Case Study 2 meant the company suddenly needed to hire and train many salespeople quickly.But sales management doesn't scale easily. Here's what the team faced:The Manual ProcessBuilding the System with ClaudeThe vision: Let AI handle boring admin work so humans focus on selling and meaningful coaching.Working with ClaudeHayden and his team described what they wanted: \"A system that automatically records sales calls, transcribes them, analyzes them against our sales methodology, scores objectively, identifies coaching opportunities, eliminates manual CRM entry, and generates all reports automatically.\"Claude created Mermaid diagrams showing workflow, wrote technical specifications, and helped think through edge cases and integrations.Acquira hired a developer for $20-30K to build what Claude had designed.The SystemWhat salespeople do: Make sure the call recorder is on. That's it. Everything else is automatic.The ResultsWhat Got EliminatedWhat Got EnabledConclusion: The Transformation is Just BeginningThese three case studies span approximately 18 months at Acquira. The results are substantial:Total impact: Hundreds of thousands in annual profit improvement from these three implementations alone.But perhaps more importantly, these cases demonstrate something about the nature of AI transformation:",
